  "notes": "A weight-stationary array in broadcast form, its PEs enabled while busy: on start PE (k, j) latches B[k][j] and keeps it for the whole product; column k of A runs through a delay line of k cycles whose head is broadcast to array row k; partial sums move down the columns, one PE per cycle; from cycle N on the bottom row shifts one output row per cycle into C. N^2 multipliers, latency 2N (8 at N = 4).",
